id=custom_usb_g2_setup
name=USB Gadget g2 Setup (NetHunter)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=NetHunter AI Operator
description=Prepares the configfs USB gadget g2 (HID keyboard + RNDIS + mass_storage) in /config/usb_gadget after boot, without touching the active system gadget g1. g2 is never bound to a UDC by this module — activation/deactivation is left to the app (UsbGadgetManager / /usbg2 API).
minMagisk=20400